# Copy to tools/.env and fill in. tools/.env is gitignored.
# Free keys, ~10 min total — see docs/12 / the how-to below.
#
# Pexels    https://www.pexels.com/api/  -> "Get Started"       (images + video, one key)
# Pixabay   https://pixabay.com/api/docs/  (key shown once logged in)
# Unsplash  https://unsplash.com/developers -> New Application  (use the Access Key)
# Jamendo   https://devportal.jamendo.com/ -> create an app     (Client ID; for tools/find_music.py)
#
# No key needed: Openverse, The Met, Art Institute of Chicago, Wikimedia Commons.

PEXELS_API_KEY=
PIXABAY_API_KEY=
UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=
JAMENDO_CLIENT_ID=
